# Copy to `secrets.properties` (it is git-ignored) and fill in your own value.
#
# Stage 16 (Explore / Inspiration) fetches photos from Pexels' official API:
#   1. Create a free account at https://www.pexels.com/api/
#   2. Generate an API key from your Pexels API dashboard.
#   3. Paste it below. Never commit the real key - this file only exists as a template.
#
# Without this file (or with an empty key), Explore still runs fine: it just shows a
# "not configured" message instead of photos - see ExploreRepository.kt.
PEXELS_API_KEY=
